  "conclusion": "Whole-book native publication, selected enrichment and exact enriched-product consumer preparation passed. New native inference was not repeated for run6. Runtime/producer provenance and partial coverage remain explicit; current scopes, legacy projections and lazy relation/deadline behavior were repaired. Eight broad-run assertion failures passed a focused rerun; the original broad receipt remains failed/incomplete after a fatal grammar deadline. The final two-file grammar/stage suite passed all 90 controls in the delegated bounded command after test-owned memo isolation; its earlier root rerun failure is preserved. Global typing and lint passed, without discarding functional evidence for cosmetic changes. Current external MCP/render, independent A/B/C authors, five-section extraction, reference registration/grading, completed PDF selection/defaults and full qualification remain unexecuted. Run6 predates the final math adapter correction, so subsequent execution needs a compatible current consumer over the retained enriched pin and newly bound reference frames.",
